# UI Components

## Philosophy

Modular, lightweight, reusable, accessible, responsive. No one-off inconsistent patterns.

## Structure

- Single responsibility; composable; **no business logic** in presentational components
- Clean props API; predictable behavior

## Styling

- **Tailwind** + **shadcn/ui** patterns from `src/components/ui/`
- No inline styles; consistent spacing, radii, shadows
- Shared design tokens (see design-language rule)

## Icons

**Lucide** — thin outline, minimal, support clarity without dominating UI

## Responsive

Mobile-first for every component; scale to tablet/desktop.

## Accessibility

Semantic HTML, labels, keyboard navigation, readable contrast, ARIA when needed.

## Animation

Subtle motion only; no performance-heavy effects in primitives.

## Reusability

Generic enough for dashboard and marketing — template-specific visuals belong in `src/templates/`, not shared UI.

## Performance

Avoid unnecessary rerenders; lazy-load heavy subcomponents when needed.

## Priority

Consistency → reusability → accessibility → responsiveness → performance
